the accused under Section 409 of the Penal Code, 1860 and Section 
5(2) of the Prevention of Corruption Act, 1947 and sent the case to the 
Divisional Special Judge, Chattogram for trial and disposal of the case. 
During the trial, charge was framed against the accused under Section 
409 of the Penal Code, 1860 and Section 5(2) of the Prevention of 
Corruption Act, 1947 which was read over to the accused and he 
pleaded not guilty to the charge. The prosecution examined 12(twelve) 
witnesses to prove the charge against the accused. After examination of 
the prosecution witnesses, the accused was examined under Section 
342 of the Code of Criminal Procedure, 1898 and he declined to adduce 
any D.W. After concluding the trial, the trial Court by impugned 
judgment and order convicted the accused and sentenced him as stated 
above against which he filed the instant appeal.    
P.W. 1 Md. Ali Hossain is the Deputy Manager, Jibon Bima 
