Policy No. 1046274-5. After recovery of the 5 premium from Md. 
Azizul Haque and one premium of Tk. 30,020 from policyholder 
Saidul Haque, he did not deposit the recovered premiums against 
their policy and misappropriated it.  
Md. Shamsuddin Ahamed, Sub-Assistant Director of the 
Anti-Corruption Commission took up the investigation of the case 
